#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:7
msgid "Selection properties panel"
msgstr "选择属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:9
msgid ""
"The selection properties panel displays the properties from the selected "
"object. Only the properties from some object can be displayed at the panel. "
"The selection properties panel can display the properties from:"
msgstr "选择属性面板显示来自选定对象的属性。只能在面板上显示来自某些对象的属性。选择属性面板可以显示来自："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:13
msgid "`Elements`_"
msgstr "`元件 <Elements_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:14
msgid ""
"Some `basic objects`_: `line`_, `rectangle`_, `ellipse`_, `polygon`_ and "
"`picture`_."
msgstr ""
"一些 `基本对象 <basic objects_>`_:`线条 <line_>`_，`矩形 <rectangle_>`_，`椭圆 "
"<ellipse_>`_，`多边形 <polygon_>`_ 和 `图片 <picture_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech selection properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 选择属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:22
msgid "To display or hidden the selection properties panel:"
msgstr "要显示或隐藏选择属性面板："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:24
msgid "Select **Settings > Display > Selection properties** menu item."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 菜单项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:26
msgid ""
"The main function of the selection properties panel is to manage the object "
"properties. At QElectroTech, the object properties can be different for each"
" object. The main tasks that can be done from the selection properties panel"
" are:"
msgstr "选择属性面板的主要功能是管理对象属性。在 QElectroTech 中，对象属性可以对每个对象不同。选择属性面板可以完成的主要任务是："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:30
msgid ""
"Manage the properties from the basic geometrical objects (`line`_, "
"`rectangle`_, `ellipse`_ and `polygon`_)."
msgstr ""
"管理基本几何对象的属性(`线条 <line_>`_，`矩形 <rectangle_>`_，`椭圆 <ellipse_>`_ 和 `多边形 "
"<polygon_>`_)."

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:31
msgid "Define the scale from the imported `pictures`_."
msgstr "从导入的 `图片中定义比例尺 <pictures_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:32
msgid ""
"Lock the position of the `basic objects`_ (`line`_, `rectangle`_, "
"`ellipse`_, `polygon`_ and `picture`_)."
msgstr ""
"锁定位置 `基本对象 <basic objects_>`_ (`线条 <line_>`_，`矩形 <rectangle_>`_，`椭圆 "
"<ellipse_>`_，`多边形 <polygon_>`_ 和 `图片 <picture_>`_)."

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:33
msgid ""
"Manage the information from the `elements`_ (label, function, manufacturer, "
"article number, order number, etc.)."
msgstr "管理来自 `元件 <elements_>`_ (标签，功能，制造商，物品号，订单号等)."

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:34
msgid "Manage the text and dynamic text from element symbols."
msgstr "从元件符号管理文本和动态文本。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:35
msgid ""
"Display the general element properties (name, position, dimensions, number "
"of terminals, etc.)."
msgstr "显示一般元素属性(名称、位置、尺寸、终端数量等)。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/selection_properties_panel.rst:36
msgid "Manage the element links (cross references)."
msgstr "管理元素链接( 交叉引用) 。"
